WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.720
La luce accarezza

00:00:02.036 --> 00:00:03.146
il pergolato

00:00:04.196 --> 00:00:04.990
e la sabbia.

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:06.584
Materiali

00:00:07.721 --> 00:00:09.077
semplici, proporzioni

00:00:10.876 --> 00:00:11.680
giuste,

00:00:11.826 --> 00:00:13.872
niente di superfluo.

00:00:14.628 --> 00:00:15.870
L'identità

00:00:16.353 --> 00:00:18.653
KORA si riconosce da

00:00:19.082 --> 00:00:19.449
un dettaglio.
